 lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학년생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">(2016</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학번</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">들의 학업역량 및 진로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">취업경쟁력 강화를 위하여 개발된 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">K-CDP</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">시스템은 재학중 활동성과를 분석</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">관리하여 대학생활 및 취업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">진로설계를 단계적으로 준비할 수 있도록 도와주는 시스템입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;이번에 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">OPEN</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">하는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">K-CDP</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">시스템은 자가진단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">프로그램 참여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">교수와의 상담</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">포트폴리오 구축으로 이어지는 일련의 과정으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학년생 여러분들에게 보다 내실있고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">풍요로운 대학생활을 제공하게 될 것입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">사이트 주소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: </span><u style=\"text-underline: #800080 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #800080; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><a href=\"http://kcdp.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">http://kcdp.kumoh.ac.kr</a></span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2. ID/Password : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">우리 학교 포탈에서 사용하는 것과 동일함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">자세한 이용 매뉴얼은 시스템에 탑재되어 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-font-widt